GFOpenTorrent: the main window's first size on AmigaOS. Windows sets
450x400 device-independent pixels; with the toolkit's 72 DPI that came
out near 340x300 on a 1920x1080 Workbench. On first start it is three
fifths of the screen's free area, at least 640x400, centred
(compat/gfot_window.hpp); a saved size still wins. Under
__WXOPENLAYOUT__, Windows' code as it was.
